'''Red Strike''' (レッドパワー, ''Reddo Pawā'', '''Red Power''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

==Effect==
"Kaijin Slayer": [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] inflict 2.5x damage against and only take 0.4x damage from [[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin enemies]].

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Red Strike|"Kaijin Slayer" Effects Activated|Scarf Cat|jpname=レッドパワー|restriction=Only [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]]}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Red Strike and [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|Yellow Strike]] are the first [[Cat Combo]]s to activate effects.

